OL,3,GNEWSABurnham says united Ireland poll
OL,4,Ais 'off the table' during first NI
OL,5,Avisit
OL,6,
OL,7,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham has ruled
OL,8,Fout calling a referendum on Irish
OL,9,Funification, describing a border poll
OL,10,Fas "off the table".
OL,12,FThe Labour leader said votes on Brexit
OL,13,Fand Scottish independence showed the
OL,14,F"risks that come from those situations
OL,15,Ftake a long time to heal".
OL,17,FSpeaking during his first official
OL,18,Fvisit to Northern Ireland, he said the
OL,19,Ffocus should instead be on public
OL,20,Fservices and tackling cost-of-living
OL,21,Fpressures.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,418,410,260,120,0,100
